#==============================================================================================
#
#   basic_shape_style_value - BasicShapeStyleValue: inset(), xywh(), rect(), circle(), ellipse(),
#                             polygon() and path()
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/BasicShapeStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-476) and the inline
#       members of BasicShapeStyleValue.h: each shape's path, serialization and computational
#       independence, and the style value's serialization and absolutization (where xywh() and
#       rect() compute to inset()). The structs' defaulted operator== (ValueComparing pointers
#       compare values) are the css_*_equal helpers.
